ry  this is not entertainment we are trying  to persuade and communicate you  ready know what Samantha power and Susan  Rice and McCabe and Co me and Brennan  and clapper you already know what role  they played so lay that out for the jury  and then I would call Biden before I  called President Obama because remember  a president Trump was impeached for  trying to investigate his political  enemies well maybe that's what Biden did  I mean I don't know it but if it's good  for president Trump wouldn't be good for  Biden it wouldn't you want to know that  here's the question you know with regard  to the names on this unmasking list it's  my understanding that it may or may not  mean much that some of those names are  there because someone else asked them to  you know put their name on the unmasking  request and that perhaps you know the  person who was behind most of the desire  to unmask those it doesn't have their  name on that list at all does that add  up to you do you agree with that it does  not I may not heard that from Samantha  power I mean the number of unmasking she  requested what was so far outside the  realm and then she said she didn't know  about most of them but but but that's a  problem too isn't it if you give the  power to someone to unmask and they're  delegating that power took to a clerk or  a subordinate this is the question for  Joe Biden we know you asked - unmai  unmasked Michael Flynn's name we know  that how many other unmasking requested  you may I mean were you a serial  unmasked her while you were the vice  president or was this the only one I  can't answer that question but I think  it's really relevant  you know I mean let me let me ask you  this because you know in terms of this  battle over whether or not this should  go so far up in terms of investigation  into Joe Biden or President Obama  there's no indication that the  Department of Justice or that John  Durham are considering either one of  those two people that I just named in